{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_079_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_079_1000_006mak", "source_sha256": "aa8ec2d83d1a3779f1a11e23e553abf23c56d49e268a2c355498253b2746e18d", "ja": "あ、いたいた、{$P$}！\nブログ、読んでくれました！？", "zh": "啊，找到了找到了，{$P$}！\n你看过我的博客了吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_079_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_079_1001_p", "source_sha256": "63d5115731b69dda05fbdc0f62601f82b940fe0c36bcd84ccad16be2ae9c2e03", "ja": "お疲れ、真。レッスン前なのにどうした？\nもちろん、コメントまでちゃんと読んでるけど……。", "zh": "辛苦了，真。还没到练习时间，怎么了？\n当然，连评论我都认真读了，不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_079_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_079_1002_006mak", "source_sha256": "7feeea76aaa00907223d1585e5dfaed8a0860a77a42906122561447b135052ae", "ja": "反響がすごい、って報告したくて！　公演を見た\nおかげで、新しい事に挑戦する勇気をもらえた、とか。", "zh": "我想告诉你，大家的反响特别热烈！有人说，看了演出之后，获得了挑战新事物的勇气。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_079_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_079_1003_006mak", "source_sha256": "3c29141cf6e6a851fee726837e3c1bfcdbd00a3f8c6ccde5426385ec6f508dc3", "ja": "気分が上がって、悩んでたことが吹っ飛んだ、とか。\nボクがみんなをなりたい自分に変えられたんだなって！", "zh": "让大家情绪高涨，烦恼也一扫而空之类的。\n看来我让大家变成了自己想成为的样子！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_079_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_079_1004_p", "source_sha256": "b64292786a03092885de565e09ddca762d57f670797740cc51562d299dbdffef", "ja": "ああ。おかげで、またあの曲をやって欲しいって\n声もたくさん届いてるぞ。次の公演も考えないとな！", "zh": "啊。多亏了你们，已经收到了许多希望再表演那首歌的呼声。也得考虑下一场公演了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_079_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_079_1005_006mak", "source_sha256": "febd53bd9d0b1d218229e9eb012b7bd30159612b5140bd79228c10bd6597feeb", "ja": "またできるんですか？　へへっ、やーりぃ！\nあっ、それならまた、振り付けを考えたいです！", "zh": "还能再表演吗？嘿嘿，太好啦！\n啊，那我想再构思一下舞蹈动作！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_079_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_079_1006_p", "source_sha256": "eab2d54a2cb831f7eeded02d930ab53f918637eb108e223f297736c0506349dc", "ja": "えっ？　変更するのか？\nダンスもかなり、好評だったんだけど……。", "zh": "诶？要改动吗？\n舞蹈也相当受好评的，不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_079_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_079_1007_006mak", "source_sha256": "79fb35bf0c3c46447b274010dbab0f493cee9137aa3c2300f3504a1097066f3c", "ja": "はい！　バレエに空手の型を取り込んだ動き、\nこの前はあきらめましたけど、挑戦してみたくって！", "zh": "是的！我想尝试一下把空手道的招式融入芭蕾动作中。之前虽然放弃了，但这次还是想挑战看看！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_079_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_079_1008_006mak", "source_sha256": "2054d7c75921ceef45589815d261a52d7685a3b150e0503b61fb46fc6eea6dae", "ja": "はっ！　せいっ！　とりゃぁ！！\n……って、どうですか？", "zh": "哈！嘿！喝呀——！！\n……怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_079_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_079_1009_p", "source_sha256": "17337c9c6a0b04932ed9ac27972f5bec044564dc5fd3e0f1ff1c73627632a106", "ja": "い、いや、どうと言われても……。\nちょっと曲と合わない気が……。", "zh": "不、不是，就算你问我怎么样……\n感觉跟歌曲有点不太搭……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_079_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_079_1010_006mak", "source_sha256": "5f9ea351606b411bc9dc14e56c88989508779db9d7a06c19fdc1d71058afefed", "ja": "うん！　なんか、すっごくイメージがわいてきました！\nよーしっ！　翼たちにも、相談してきますね！", "zh": "嗯！总觉得一下子涌现出好多灵感！\n好——！我去找翼她们商量一下！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_079_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_079_1011_p", "source_sha256": "bf6fadc1baa3772c1e582ae4dbf1dd00e99ab0c40b1f9db6026ddcf31985ec53", "ja": "あっ、真……って、あっというまに、行ってしまった。\nまた調子にのらないといいけど……。まあ、いいか。", "zh": "啊，真……转眼就跑得没影了。\n可别又得意忘形了啊……算了，由她去吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_079_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_079_1012_p", "source_sha256": "55a841c05d383c80012d7b171243e60b025a5d620ef67a8aba557cdbb33ffed2", "ja": "（ちょっとしたことで一喜一憂して、まっすぐに\n進んでいく。それは真の魅力のひとつなんだから……）", "zh": "（会因为一点小事而时喜时忧，然后一心一意地向前走。这正是真魅力的一面啊……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
